t": "en", "type": "word", "start": 15, "end": 15.04}, {"text": "zuurstof.", "type": "word", "start": 15.12, "end": 16.16}, {"text": "Met", "type": "word", "start": 16.28, "end": 16.4}, {"text": "die", "type": "word", "start": 16.48, "end": 16.56}, {"text": "suiker", "type": "word", "start": 16.64, "end": 16.96}, {"text": "bouwt", "type": "word", "start": 17.12, "end": 17.28}, {"text": "de", "type": "word", "start": 17.36, "end": 17.44}, {"text": "plant,", "type": "word", "start": 17.64, "end": 18.08}, {"text": "en", "type": "word", "start": 18.12, "end": 18.16}, {"text": "hij", "type": "word", "start": 18.2, "end": 18.32}, {"text": "verbrandt", "type": "word", "start": 18.4, "end": 18.8}, {"text": "hem,", "type": "word", "start": 18.88, "end": 19.2}, {"text": "dag", "type": "word", "start": 19.28, "end": 19.6}, {"text": "en", "type": "word", "start": 19.68, "end": 19.76}, {"text": "nacht.", "type": "word", "start": 19.84, "end": 20.64}, {"text": "En", "type": "word", "start": 20.68, "end": 20.72}, {"text": "de", "type": "word", "start": 20.8, "end": 20.88}, {"text": "zonnebloem", "type": "word", "start": 20.96, "end": 21.28}, {"text": "van", "type": "word", "start": 21.36, "end": 21.52}, {"text": "twee", "type": "word", "start": 21.547, "end": 21.68}, {"text": "meter?", "type": "word", "start": 21.76, "end": 22.56}, {"text": "Vooral", "type": "word", "start": 22.6, "end": 22.88}, {"text": "gemaakt", "type": "word", "start": 22.96, "end": 23.36}, {"text": "van", "type": "word", "start": 23.48, "end": 23.6}, {"text": "water", "type": "word", "start": 23.8, "end": 24}, {"text": "en", "type": "word", "start": 24.08, "end": 24.16}, {"text": "lucht.", "type": "word", "start": 24.24, "end": 24.88}, {"text": "Met", "type": "word", "start": 24.96, "end": 25.04}, {"text": "zonlicht", "type": "word", "start": 25.16, "end": 25.6}, {"text": "als", "type": "word", "start": 25.68, "end": 25.76}, {"text": "energie.", "type": "word", "start": 25.84, "end": 26.56}], "text": "Een plant eet geen aarde. Hij maakt zijn eigen voedsel: fotosynthese. Wortels halen water, de stengel brengt het omhoog. Door de huidmondjes komt koolstofdie-oxide binnen. Bladgroenkorrels vangen licht. Zo ontstaan suiker en zuurstof. Met die suiker bouwt de plant, en hij verbrandt hem, dag en nacht. En de zonnebloem van twee meter? Vooral gemaakt van water en lucht. Met zonlicht als energie."}